# append paths keep working. Canonical location: $LPP_BOARD.
docs/QUEUE_PROGRESS.md
docs/board-archive/
# wq#1375: the live primary tree (/home/lumen/pokemon) carries these three as
# host-local operational state, and `sync-live` refuses to deploy while
# `git status --porcelain` is non-empty — so leaving them untracked-but-visible
# wedges every deploy. assets/ is the stream overlay media the kiosk serves,
# fallback_stats.jsonl is generated per run, and tools/lpp-pstack is a symlink
# into /home/lumen/pstack (the skill checkout), not repo content.
assets/
fallback_stats.jsonl
tools/lpp-pstack
FLEET_STATUS_NOTICE_READ_ME.txt
MAINTENANCE_NOTICE_READ_ME.txt
docs/NOTICE-POWERBAR-20260807.md
deploy_powerbar.sh
deploy_powerbar2.sh
lumen-pokemon-live.service.bak

